YUNG's Bridges for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of YUNG's Bridges by YUNGNICKYOUNG.
Original source: https://github.com/YUNG-GANG/YUNGs-Bridges
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-only

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the bridge feature, its crossing
search and its template processors are written in Rust on the Sunrise mod API; no Java code is
included. The bridge templates (src/bridges.rs, decoded by tools/gen_bridges.py) and the data in
data/yungsbridges are the original's. This port is distributed under the same licence; LICENSE is
the GNU LGPL v3 text and COPYING the GNU GPL v3 text it builds on.
